{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/99756-a-loss-phobie-sunshine-moorman-player-passed-away-firnost-freehold-player","id":99756,"title":"A Loss: Phobie \"Sunshine\" Moorman player passed away (Firnost Freehold player)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-26T22:12:19-07:00","id":99756,"title":"A Loss: Phobie \"Sunshine\" Moorman player passed away (Firnost Freehold player)","content":"Players in the old &quot;Firnost Freehold&quot; White Wolf chat may remember an upbeat Satyr character by the name of &quot;<b>Phobie Sunshine</b>&quot;. That's where I first met her as &quot;Grieg Moorman.&quot;<br /> Her player, <b>Luci Byrd</b>, was an active member and officer of the Camarilla back in the day, playing CWoD and NWoD.<br /> <br /> Monday, Luci passed away from a pulmonary embolism. She was an amazingly brilliant soul. She had an amazing gift of just making everyone smile, and her energy could illuminate a room.<br /> <br /> Luci Byrd will be deeply missed.<br /> <br /> Please keep her husband Dan, her family ,and friends in your prayers.<br /> <br /> Her facebook is: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/foxykitsune\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/foxykitsune</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10201472266024011\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://scontent-a-ord.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn2/t1.0-9/10007019_10201472266024011_1106141626_n.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> Above is a REALLY old picture I drew of Phobie and Grieg back in the day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, M